{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41639","headline":"冬夜吟 · 陈陶","name":"冬夜吟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"黑夜天寒愁散玉，东皇海上张仙烛。\n侯家歌舞按梨园，石氏宾寮醉金谷。\n鲁家襜褕闇披水，雪花灯下甘垂翅。\n散帙高编折桂枝，披纱密甃青云地。\n霜白溪松转斜尽，铜龙唤曙咽声细。\n八埏蝼蚁厌寒栖，早晚青旗引春帝。\n展转城乌啼紫天，曈曚千骑衙楼前。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈陶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41639.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41639","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}